        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased. Registered File number 31783/1901.\n\nNote on register:\nCushion-cover embroidered with a longevity peach and five flying bats, emblems of happiness, in the central medallion; encircled by a swastika fret diapered ground, overlaid with bats carrying felicitous emblems in their mouths bound with waving fillets."@en ;
