        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cushion cover of yellow silk satin, embroidered with coloured silks. The design is composed of a central medallion of branches of peach and bats. The remaining space is filled with bats carrying felicitous emblems in their mouths, on a ground of swastika fret-pattern."@en ;
